    },
    "A few misses in a row. A short break often helps, and everything you did today counts." : {
      "comment" : "Suggests a break after accuracy dropped.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein paar Antworten hintereinander falsch. Eine kurze Pause hilft oft, und alles, was du heute geschafft hast, zählt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Has fallado varias veces seguidas. Un descanso breve suele ayudar, y todo lo que has hecho hoy cuenta."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tu as fait plusieurs erreurs de suite. Une courte pause peut aider, et tout ce que tu as fait aujourd’hui compte."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Você errou algumas seguidas. Uma pausa rápida costuma ajudar, e tudo o que você fez hoje conta."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A few questions on an idea you missed." : {
      "comment" : "How a content-gap drill goes, without ideas to show.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein paar Fragen zu einem Thema, das du verpasst hast."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Unas preguntas sobre una idea que no dominabas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quelques questions sur une notion que tu as manquée."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Algumas perguntas sobre uma ideia que você errou."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A few questions on each subject. The ones you need most come first and get more depth." : {
      "comment" : "What a focus test does.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein paar Fragen zu jedem Fach. Die Fächer, die du am meisten brauchst, kommen zuerst und werden ausführlicher behandelt."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Unas preguntas de cada asignatura. Primero van las que más necesitas y se trabajan con más profundidad."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quelques questions sur chaque matière. Celles dont tu as le plus besoin arrivent d’abord et sont plus approfondies."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Algumas perguntas de cada matéria. As que você mais precisa vêm primeiro e são exploradas a fundo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A few questions on this chapter. Do well, and your plan skips what you already know." : {
      "comment" : "What a chapter test-out does.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ein paar Fragen zu diesem Kapitel. Wenn du gut abschneidest, lässt dein Plan weg, was du schon weißt."
